BT 1 0 0 1 0 190.8 Tm /F2 10.8 Tf 14.4 TL 1.962514 Tw (The Trinity Accord combines three fixed texts, a dated human\226AI Chronicle, creative works, a material) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.383171 Tw (referent, and later preservation and response systems. This critical case study asks how those components) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.427839 Tw (establish an address to possible future intelligence without establishing the truth of that address or the) Tj T* 0 Tw .246085 Tw (authority of its custodians. It reads three complete original-text mirrors and five purposively selected musical) Tj T* 0 Tw .450276 Tw (or epistolary records at a fixed repository commit. A source-linked interpretive matrix distinguishes speaker,) Tj T* 0 Tw .176122 Tw (requested relationship, rhetorical mode, and counterreading. The selected voices vary, but a common concern) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.657799 Tw (for human continuity limits the stronger claim that they form an open-ended philosophical polyphony. A) Tj T* 0 Tw .591507 Tw (reproducible before-and-after examination of the reading interface supplies a second result: the old snapshot) Tj T* 0 Tw .333359 Tw (test accepted a page missing source passages, whereas the repaired interface and seven bounded fidelity tests) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.721353 Tw (preserve and check the raw text. Four functional comparisons situate future address, material readability,) Tj T* 0 Tw .611099 Tw (waiting, and computational critique without claiming global uniqueness. The analysis separates fixed source) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.659342 Tw (identity, interpretive standing, and practical custody. It concludes that the Accord supports inquiry into a) Tj T* 0 Tw .884699 Tw (historically situated relationship proposal, not proof of philosophical necessity, successful alignment, or the) Tj T* 0 Tw (end of human authorship. Its specific formation is closed; its interpretation and historical class remain open.) Tj T* ET
